6598 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Shadow cast at a 45\021degree elevation reveals partial structure\056 The direction of the illumination determines which elements are concealed and which are exposed\056\n\nFind the NuCaloric 527 unit that is running an active scan rpt inside of Processing to determine the input\056\240\n\nInput your answer from top left to bottom right if your S\057N has the same or more amount of zeros in it \050as the NuCaloric unit\054 use the first 3 numbers on the NuCaloric unit and the SHAPE 1\056\n\nUse the 4th 5th and 6th number that appears on the NuCaloric unit and SHAPE 2 if the S\057N has a H and apply it top left to bottom right if it has more numbers than letters otherwise apply it from bottom right to top left\056\n\nUse the 7th 8th and 9th number that appears on the NuCaloric unit and SHAPE 3 when the S\057N ends with the number 1 and apply it top left to bottom right when there are more than 4 numbers in the S\057N otherwise apply from bottom right to top left\056\240\n\nUse the last 3 numbers on the NuCaloric unit and SHAPE 5 if the S\057N begins with a C and ends on 0\056 Apply it top left to bottom right if the sum of the numbers in the S\057N are even otherwise apply it bottom right to top left\056\240\n\nIf the sum of the S\057N is exactly 24\054 use the first 3 numbers on the NuCaloric uniT and SHAPE 1 and apply it bottom right to top left\056\240\n\n\nUse the 10th 11th and 12th numbers on the NuCaloric unit and SHAPE 4 if your S\057N has not been covered\056 You will have to troubleshoot your way forward\056 Initially\054 try applying it top left to bottom right and otherwise try bottom right to top left\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 6599 0 R
     /Pg 1034 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

