9160 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UESC Marathon\047s which must be validated under live conditions\056\n\nEngineering crews will conduct conduit interruption drills during Cryo Archive systems calibration phases \050to confirm routing integrity\054 serial authentication compliance\054 and load balancing responsiveness under timed constraints\056\240\n\nIn this manual you\031ve been provided a zone designation\054 pointing to power nodes that serve as an authorized training node\056 Each node contains multi\021colored conduits feeding capped power regulators\056\240\n\nPersonnel must identify the correct conduit for temporary interruption using assigned serial parameters and current timer state\056)
     /K [ 19 ]
     /P 9161 0 R
     /Pg 6138 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

